doldecomp/melee project as a reference, principally its
src/sysdolphin/baselib and extern/dolphin/include trees. The reproducible
reference snapshot recorded for this integration is:

  https://github.com/doldecomp/melee/commit/81153faa93ea558e08d102007f9b663ddb526884

This notice records source provenance. It does not grant rights to third-party
material or supersede the rights described above.

The Dolphin SDK paired-single quality-gate exception was verified against the
public zeldaret/tww SDK reconstruction at this pinned snapshot:

  https://github.com/zeldaret/tww/commit/6f09bf28ce1a2f1cdea62b931cbbdb40e7f821ec

The relevant reference files are src/dolphin/mtx/mtx.c, mtxvec.c, vec.c, and
quat.c. This records technical provenance for the exception; it does not widen
the licensing statement above.

